<title>FRANCE: ONIC reports wheat export bids of 6.77-16.95 Ecu.</title>
<headline>ONIC reports wheat export bids of 6.77-16.95 Ecu.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exporters made the following bids for refunds to export free-market grain at this week's EU tender, French cereals office ONIC said. Bids are in Ecus/tonne.</p>
<p>		     --- Mar 6 ---		 --- Feb 27 ---</p>
<p>		 Tonnage  Range of Bids     Tonnage  Range of Bids</p>
<p> Soft wheat  692,000   6.77-16.95	 942,500  11.79-17.74</p>
<p> Barley	209,000  26.89-30.89	 212,000  26.48-30.98</p>
<p> Durum wheat No bids			  No bids</p>
<p> Rye	   No bids			  No bids</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5146</p>
</text>
